  /// the union of two leg_k-deep lists, missing docs mediocre in both
  /// legs but strong fused), every doc in the corpus is accounted for.
  /// Requires both weights > 0 and globally comparable raw scores per
  /// leg (shared calibration, global stats).
  ///
  /// Execution is BM25-first with decomposed floors over the streaming
  /// vector path (docs/multi-field.md "Hybrid streaming interplay"):
  ///   1. the BM25 leg runs to depth leg_k (milliseconds; postings over
  ///      a few terms). Its top score b_1 is the EXACT global maximum
  ///      b(d), the bound every decomposed floor divides through.
  ///   2. VectorRescore pins v(d) for the leg's top k docs — k true
  ///      fused scores, whose k-th best s_0 is a lower bound on the
  ///      final fused k-th best. Every vector stream then opens with
