  ///      its b(d), so pruning it is lossless. (A BM25-only bound can
  ///      never floor the vector scan — the top lexical doc could sit
  ///      at any vector score — which is why phase 2 exists.)
  ///   3. as emissions accumulate, the coordinator's k-th best known
